      "missing_indices": [],
      "idea": "I propose a **Spectral Proximity Heuristic** that enhances the dynamic return-aware approach by incorporating a geometric centrality measure. While Algorithm 3 dynamically balances immediate cost against destination return distance, it ignores the local structure of unvisited nodes. My method computes a \"spectral centrality\" score for each candidate, defined as the mean distance to all other unvisited nodes. This penalizes outliers that would create long, inefficient detours later. The total cost is a convex combination: immediate distance, destination return distance (weighted by progress), and the centrality penalty. This ensures the path stays close to the destination while maintaining a compact cluster of remaining nodes."
    },
